`benchmark.meta description: Mixed Map operations over 64-byte values at 80,000 entries.
`benchmark.meta timing: recommended
`benchmark.meta profiles: compile-timing

/core

. count = 80000 as Size
. map = Map'U64'WideValue()
for index in 0 .. < count
    . value = index as U64
    map[value] = WideValue(value)

. checksum = 0u64
for index in 0 .. < count
    checksum += (map[index as U64]!).a
for index in 0 .. < count by 2
    -= map[index as U64]
checksum += map.length as U64

-- "bench-result map/mixed-uniform-large-80000 checksum=$checksum"

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ WideValue is Struct

+ a U64
+ b U64
+ c U64
+ d U64
+ e U64
+ f U64
+ g U64
+ h U64

────────────────────
+ This
    - value U64

a = value
b = value + 1
c = value + 2
d = value + 3
e = value + 4
f = value + 5
g = value + 6
h = value + 7
